<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH PX50 RISES AT FIXING.</title>
<headline>CZECH PX50 RISES AT FIXING.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech PX50 index rose at Thursday's fixing pushed by small gains to the major issues.</p>
<p>SPT Telecom rose two crowns to 3,485, CEZ gained one crown to 1,051, Komercni Banka rose six crowns to 2,305 and Ceska Sporitelna gained eight crowns to 307.</p>
<p>Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
